    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "Began operation\nSFOE→ ORD\nJuly 1972\nTWA's NEW\nmeet the most modern\nplane in the world\nTWA's NEW",
      "and the most comfortable\nThe L-1011 has been called \"the next\ngeneration of the jet age.\"\nIt brings together every significant ad-\nvance in aircraft design and comfort you've\never enjoyed on any other plane.\nOn TWA's L-1011, you'll find the spa-\nciousness of our 747's. The Coach and First\nClass lounges and special new seats of\nour 747's and 707's. Dining service that\neliminates, for the first time on any airplane,\nthe need for aisle carts. Even the carry-on\nluggage compartments of our 727's. Plus\nmany new comfort features that make TWA's\nL-1011 the premier new member of the most\ncomfortable fleet of planes in the world.\nWhen you fly TWA's L-1011, you get our\npopular Ambassador Service:\nAmbassador Service is a total travel ex-\nperience. It means curbside check-in and\ncontainerized handling for your baggage.\nGate area ticketing. And a Ground\nAmbassador in the departure lounge.\nIn flight, you have a choice of 5 entrees\nin First Class, 3 in Coach. Premium brands\nof liquor, imported wines and champagnes,\nand 8 channels of stereo.\nAmbassador Service and the L-1011.\nNobody else gives you anything like it.\nTHE COACH LOUNGE\nIthas a big, fully equipped\nbar. Comfortable seats\nand alcoves to stretch out\nand relax in. And a most\nconvivial atmosphere.\nCOACH\nThe new Twin Seats in\nTWA's L- 1011 are the\nfinest Coach seats in the\nair. You'll never have to\nsit more than two across.\nIn the center section,\nseats fold down and the\narm rests fold up. If the\nplane's not full, you can\nhave a private area for\nwork or conversation or\neven an enormous couch.\nMORE SPACE\nEVERYWHERE\nThe L-1011 gives you\nmore individual aisle and\nseat space than any other\nplane we fly. There are\ncarry-on luggage com-\npartments in First Class\nand Coach. Self-locking\noverhead compartments.\nCoat compartments and\nspecial racks that disap-\npear into the wall at the\ntouch of a button.\nFIRST CLASS\nThe whole First Class\nlounge. in the center, club\naround\nlounge\ntables swivel 270 degrees.\nVery convenient for con-\nversation or cocktails. At\nmeal time, we'll soon be\nserving rather elegant\ndinners for four at these\nlocations.\nSTREAMLINED\nMEAL SERVICE\nFor the first ume on dry\nplane, you'll enjoy the\ndual advantage of a be-\nlow-deck galley and the\naisles free of serving\ncarts. Meals are prepared\nin the galley's high speed\novens, brought upstairs\nby special elevators 10\nsatellite centers, and per-\nsonally served by your\nflight attendant.\nCabin interiors by Charles bu"
    ],
